\">Peter</span>: The drapes are really cool.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, they match the throw pillows ... and the lampshades!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, I got those in Jordan.  I may put those in the den.", "id": 3, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le18ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you put them in the den, I won't be able to see them when I come to visit. They're so gorgeous! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What will you do with that empty wall over there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll leave it blank for now. I'll ask the interior designer about that.", "id": 4, "time": "32500", "image": "engenn5le18ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So ... Peter, tell us what's going on with you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, you're being very mysterious ...", "id": 5, "time": "45500", "image": "engenn5le18ob05re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob05re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob05re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Reunion"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Talking The Night Away"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le18ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals May, Might, Will"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">may </span> and <span class=\"italic\">might </span> to show possibility. They have the same meaning.  <br> You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will </span> to predict the future in a more certain way."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Modals go before a verb in the base form. The verb does not change."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll leave that wall blank for now. I'll ask the interior designer what she thinks.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I might buy some artwork to add some color to that room? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I may hang up my pictures next week."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you add some color to that one wall, it may brighten up the entire room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do   something. In that condition, something else will happen."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If you put them in the den, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I won't be able to see them.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If I ask the teacher to help me, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I will pass the test.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If he gets his dream job,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" he will be very happy.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lampshade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the part of the lamp that covers the light bulb"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The pillows match the lampshade."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about rooms and objects."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "throw pillow"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a decorative pillow you put on a couch "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The throw pillows match the lampshades."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drape "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "curtain; long pieces of material that cover windows"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The drapes are really cool."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "batik"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fabric that is colored in many colors, common in Asian countries "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought those batiks in Turkey."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to decorate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to make a room look nice by adding furniture and patterns "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love the way you decorated the room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interior designer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person who helps you decorate a room "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I might get an interior designer to help me decorate this room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blank"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "empty; no pattern or color "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll leave the wall blank for now."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "den"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small room in a house used for studying or relaxing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I may put those in the den."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find an old magazine. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Cut out pictures of furniture and other elements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Arrange them on a paper as though you are decorating a room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your picture to your partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the room."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create a picture of a room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe the elements to my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We discuss the room."}]}], "type": "sena"}